            {
              "id": "362a5044-550a-4d5a-a811-2842dee8c424",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>The Sports &amp; Pastimes of the People of England</strong></em> was written by Joseph Strutt, originally published in 1801."
            },
            {
              "id": "59185cc8-d590-43e0-8c1a-b69655d02bac",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "ba5f7e17-b139-4612-9269-7c270732ecdc",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>Joseph Strutt wrote this fantastic book that compiles and describes in detail all kind of sports, games and pastimes practised by adults and children in England during the 18th century. A must read to understand English society as we know it today.</em>"
            },
            {
